1
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,100
I knew he wouldn't pay up easily

2
00:00:05,266 --> 00:00:07,800
Glad I swapped it with water beforehand

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,033
Mom, Dad

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,766
Lewes, no matter what

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,100
they are your elders after all

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,700
Calm them down first

7
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,900
If someone actually dies

8
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,000
you'll be in huge trouble

9
00:00:19,066 --> 00:00:20,066
Spit it out, now

10
00:00:20,066 --> 00:00:21,000
Stay back

11
00:00:29,033 --> 00:00:30,966
Lewes, I'm begging you

12
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,400
Save my parents

13
00:00:37,033 --> 00:00:37,566
Mom, Dad

14
00:00:37,866 --> 00:00:38,733
Calm down, both of you

15
00:00:39,266 --> 00:00:41,666
I'll pay, just toss the medicine

16
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,000
Go get your stomachs pumped now

17
00:00:44,866 --> 00:00:46,966
No, give me the money first

18
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,133
Daniel, are you even human

19
00:00:49,133 --> 00:00:50,166
Paraquat is lethal

20
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,300
One sip is all it takes

21
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:52,133
Just for money

22
00:00:52,133 --> 00:00:54,166
you'd ignore your parents' lives

23
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,400
That's on you too

24
00:00:55,533 --> 00:00:56,966
You should've paid sooner

25
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,133
Right, money first

26
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:01,433
