28
00:01:04,933 --> 00:01:06,633
Fine, no time for cash

29
00:01:06,666 --> 00:01:07,500
I'll transfer the money

30
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:09,666
Should've just agreed earlier

31
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:10,966
