32
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:17,900
Money, I finally have the money

33
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:22,700
Finally got it, let's go

34
00:01:22,866 --> 00:01:24,266
The sun's making me dizzy

35
00:01:24,266 --> 00:01:25,500
I need to go sleep it off

36
00:01:31,366 --> 00:01:32,300
Sandra

37
00:01:36,233 --> 00:01:37,666
Oh no, the poison's kicking in

38
00:01:37,666 --> 00:01:38,566
To the hospital, quick

39
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,233
Mom, Dad, what's wrong

40
00:01:40,233 --> 00:01:42,066
Mom, Dad

41
00:01:42,233 --> 00:01:42,733
Dad

42
00:01:44,266 --> 00:01:45,400
With my sister here

43
00:01:45,633 --> 00:01:47,333
Lewes won't ignore Mom and Dad

44
00:01:47,333 --> 00:01:50,000
I can take this money and disappear
